1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,200
He built a three point four
trillion dollar company.

2
00:00:03,299 --> 00:00:05,799
Then he cheated on his wife.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,000
Three times.

4
00:00:07,099 --> 00:00:08,000
One of them? A Chinese spy.

5
00:00:08,099 --> 00:00:10,300
This is the story of
Jensen Huang and NVIDIA.

6
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,000
First, Alice Huang.
A businesswoman in Singapore

7
00:00:13,099 --> 00:00:16,500
that U.S. intelligence says
was a Chinese spy.

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,500
Then, Kimberly Powell,
his own VP at NVIDIA.

9
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,500
She reported directly to him.

10
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,500
Caught on video
at a San Jose hotel.

11
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,000
And then, hours after he resigned,

12
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,500
Reuters dropped another bombshell.

13
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:32,500
A third affair with
another NVIDIA employee.

14
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:35,299
His wife Lori, married to him
since nineteen eighty five.

15
00:00:35,399 --> 00:00:38,000
Thirty three years as CEO.
Gone in one week.

16
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,000
The board didn't even fight it.

17
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,500
NVIDIA stock crashed
fourteen percent at the open.

18
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,000
It recovered to close
down four percent,

19
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,000
but the real damage?

20
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:50,000
One point six trillion dollars
in market value,

21
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:53,799
wiped out over six weeks.
That's bigger than the
entire GDP of Australia.

22
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,500
AMD surged thirty percent
this week.

23
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,799
Broadcom jumped
twenty four percent.

24
00:00:58,899 --> 00:01:01,000
But NVIDIA's partners got crushed.

25
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,500
CoreWeave dropped seven percent,
and TSMC fell with it.

26
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,000
Analysts now value NVIDIA at
two twenty five per share

27
00:01:06,099 --> 00:01:08,500
without Jensen,
down from three hundred.

28
00:01:08,599 --> 00:01:12,000
The new interim CEO, Colette Kress,
is a finance executive,

29
00:01:12,099 --> 00:01:13,799
not an engineer.

30
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:16,000
And NVIDIA's earnings drop
November seventeenth.

31
00:01:16,099 --> 00:01:18,500
Can anyone replace
the man in the leather jacket?

32
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:21,000
The bull case. NVIDIA is at
its cheapest valuation in years,

33
00:01:21,099 --> 00:01:22,500
and AI demand isn't slowing.

34
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:25,000
The bear case. No successor,
a spy scandal,

35
00:01:25,099 --> 00:01:26,500
and Congress wants answers.

36
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:28,000
This is not financial advice.

37
00:01:28,099 --> 00:01:30,500
Follow for more finance breakdowns.

38
